1. OWNERSHIP & INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY RIGHTS

1.1 Exclusive Ownership

Proprietors retain exclusive ownership of all intellectual property, tangible and intangible, including but not limited to manuscripts, recordings, strategic documents, operational procedures, logos, trademarks, service marks, trade names, domain names, databases, software code, photography, video content, names, likenesses, financial information, confidential information, and all authorized derivative works.

Nothing in this Agreement transfers any ownership interest to any user.

1.2 Copyright Notice

All copyrightable works are protected under 17 U.S.C. § 102 et seq.

Copyright © 2026 John Thompson and Lost Limb Riders, Inc.

Certain works may be registered with the United States Copyright Office. Statutory damages, attorney fees, and other remedies may apply where authorized by law and where applicable registration and timing requirements have been satisfied.

1.3 No Waiver

No action, inaction, delay, omission, or course of dealing shall constitute a waiver of any rights under this Agreement or applicable law.

