8. LIMITED LICENSE; NO TRANSFER OF OWNERSHIP

8.1 Access Does Not Transfer Ownership

Authorized access grants only a narrow, revocable, non-transferable permission to access and use specified materials for the limited purposes stated in this Agreement.

Access grants no:

- Ownership interest
- Right of publication
- Right of commercial exploitation
- Right to reproduce materials beyond authorized operational necessity
- Right to modify or create derivative works
- Right to distribute or disclose materials
- Right to sublicense or transfer access
- Right to register intellectual property
- Right to claim authorship, inventorship, partnership, joint ownership, or contribution rights

8.2 All Rights Reserved

Proprietors reserve all rights not expressly granted in writing.

No right, permission, waiver, license, or authorization shall arise by implication, estoppel, prior conduct, silence, or course of dealing.

