9. SURVIVAL CLAUSE

The following provisions survive termination, expiration, suspension, revocation, separation, or loss of access:

- Ownership and intellectual-property rights
- Trademark, service-mark, trade-dress, and brand restrictions
- Confidentiality and non-disclosure obligations
- Trade-secret protections
- Restrictions on use, reproduction, retention, and disclosure
- Return, deletion, and destruction obligations
- Indemnification obligations
- Enforcement rights
- Governing-law and jurisdiction provisions
- Any payment, reimbursement, or remedial obligations arising from a breach

